    "created_at": null,
    "description": "How to Train During the Cold Months of the Year Training becomes difficult for runners during the winter. Our trails through the woods become covered with snow. Ice and snow also make running on the roads tricky. Cold weather forces us to bundle up, slowing our strides. Add to that, the narrow window of daylight ... Continue reading \"Winter\"",
